# GETTING INTO THE PLAN'S HALL QUIETLY (docs/interiors, 21_doors, FightSim
# suspicion): the warden stands its watch facing the bays with the hatch at its
# back. What it only half has -- a step heard, a glimpse behind its cone -- makes
# it unsure, and unsure long enough it turns to look; only what it sees in its
# cone makes it sure. The turrets sweep their eyes to and fro on a fixed rhythm.
# So down the hatch crouched, out of the residents' sight, crossing each turret's
# ground while it looks away, is the way to a strongbox unseen.
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/hall-sneak.tour --seed=4 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0
#
# 01 is the hall just come down into, crouched, the warden's back to the player.
# 02 is at a strongbox, having waited out the turrets' sweeps: nothing in the
# hall has noticed the player (`unnoticed`).
coast calm
near door:weapons_hall
await door 5
hold crouch
press use 0.1
await inside:weapons_hall 5
wait 0.3
shot 01-down-the-hatch-crouched with inside:weapons_hall,mob:warden
# Waiting where the next step would be seen, as a patient player learns the
# turrets' sweep: it takes a while.
walkto strongbox 45
wait 0.4
shot 02-at-a-strongbox-unseen with inside:weapons_hall,box_near,unnoticed
